(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-36","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["沈砚把一[[lump|块]]封蜡装入布袋，它与钟楼旧印很[[resemble|相像]]。季禾检查水口，不让积水再[[breed|滋生]]麻烦，旧[[tunnel|地道]]已经不用人钻。孩子送来一根[[feather|羽毛]]作谢礼，罗清请[[expert|熟手]]先保后续[[welfare|照护]]，不要把病者[[drag|拖]]去送行。陶溯的旧冠饰像一顶[[crown|王冠]]，如今放在查验桌上，没替他减责。沈砚去[[inquire|问]]返粮进度，发现没有领票的两家还漏着，便请配粮人按原户册补上，不因即将离城就把最后的查核省掉。","城中空[[gymnasium|练武馆]]改为物资点，宽处让人搬罐不再[[vain|徒劳]]。一个[[youngster|孩子]]帮数床角，祭司整理旧[[literature|文献]]供取水[[inquiry|调查]]，上面不按外来本地分责。沈砚对难民先前的[[prejudice|偏见]]也逐渐[[dissolve|消散]]，但承认自己曾觉得只要自家渠通就够；旁人能不能[[digest|消化领会]]这句认错，要看后面的水。那位[[immigrant|迁来的居民]]展示补船的[[ability|本领]]，不再只是待救的人。船上的细[[slender|长的]]测杆刻好日数，他们要继续量城渠，公开报上游来水。","一份[[oral|口头的]]共同承诺不能替明年的播[[sow|种]]留下足水。季禾说明接头[[tolerance|公差]]，让工人[[fasten|系牢]]尺绳，原图[[author|绘制者]]的姓名也保留。两名家属清井边[[dirt|污泥]]，罗清借[[greenhouse|暖房]]安置怕冷的病童。沈砚写给钟楼的[[essay|短文]]不用庆功标题，只写水位[[survey|测量]]与赔费。有一处临时[[plug|塞子]]还要每旬看，医馆[[thermometer|温度计]]也不能因为一天数值[[favourable|良好]]就证明全城已无病。顾衡帮他把这些未尽事项逐条交给真正留城的人。","季禾留下[[hammer|锤子]]与一把旧尺，工人不问使用者的[[racial|种族的]]出身。水总得[[somehow|以具体办法]]到家，不能靠一句人人平等就跨过石壁。最后一班[[drill|训练]]教的是如何在卡闸时停下、如何叫人，而不是让青年逞强。外乡[[christian|基督教的]]商客也贡献一车干布，祭司不要求改信才接。他们为[[convenience|方便]]所开的小路仍有踏坏菜地的费用。沈砚代医馆的[[behalf|利益]]签账，不拿救人次数作免赔理由，旁边的屋主终于能安心收下那张有数目的欠单。","不能再[[victimize|使受害]]同一群搬运工，查账的[[scandal|丑闻]]不是逼他们补叙述的借口。伤友说压腿那一夜[[horrible|可怕]]，现在不想再讲，季禾便点头。顾衡携[[portable|便携的]]水尺返山，他们的[[mission|任务]]是请上游兑现旧约，不是再找一个坏人替所有人背债。许庭不肯无偿[[wander|绕走]]远路，双方写下运货路钱；他的[[cabin|船舱]]保管货，证纸由三户分持。罗清脚[[heel|后跟]]磨破，沈砚问是否留城，她说城里已有能接班的人，山上的[[variety|不同种类]]水源还要查。这一次选择仍由她自己作。","大家会[[persist|坚持]]，也会累。出城时旧井前没有红票，低屋仍在等各自份额，尚谈不上没有争执的天堂。船到上游叉口，一根新锁链横过公共支渠，牌上写少数山门轮流修炼，下游只取余水。顾衡对照旧公约，发现这里的印正是其中三家；许庭运输单也盖过这些印，没有忽然冒出的陌生主谋。他们不拆链，先抄当前水位和取水时辰，再通知各村。钟楼在下一段山路后，韩长老知道旧支渠的图，他们要让他在承担旧责的前提下提供知识。带回来的不只是外埠欠款，更是自家规矩还没做到的边界。"],"en":["A [[lump|lump]] of wax began to [[resemble|resemble]] the tower’s old seal. Ji checked that stagnant pockets would not [[breed|breed]] trouble; nobody needed the [[tunnel|tunnel]] now. A child offered a [[feather|feather]]. Luo asked an [[expert|expert]] to continue [[welfare|welfare]] care instead of having patients [[drag|drag]] themselves to farewell. Tao’s [[crown|crown]] ornament stayed on an evidence table. Shen went to [[inquire|inquire]] about food returns and corrected two missing households before departing.","An empty [[gymnasium|gymnasium]] became a supplies point, making carrying less [[vain|vain]]. A [[youngster|youngster]] counted beds while the priest prepared [[literature|literature]] for water [[inquiry|inquiry]]. Shen’s [[prejudice|prejudice]] began to [[dissolve|dissolve]], though he admitted once valuing only his home channel. Others could [[digest|digest]] that admission through future action. An [[immigrant|immigrant]] demonstrated boat-repair [[ability|ability]]. A [[slender|slender]] measuring rod recorded dates, keeping city flow reports public.","An [[oral|oral]] promise did not secure next year’s [[sow|sowing]]. Ji explained connector [[tolerance|tolerance]] and helped [[fasten|fasten]] the measuring line. The map [[author|author]] stayed named. Families cleared [[dirt|dirt]], and a [[greenhouse|greenhouse]] sheltered cold-sensitive children. Shen’s [[essay|essay]] to the tower reported [[survey|survey]] measurements and costs, not triumph. A [[plug|plug]] needed regular checking, and a [[favourable|favourable]] [[thermometer|thermometer]] reading did not prove illness ended. Gu assigned unfinished tasks to those staying.","Ji left a [[hammer|hammer]] and ruler without [[racial|racial]] restrictions. Water must [[somehow|somehow]] cross real walls; equality alone did not move it. Their final [[drill|drill]] taught safe stopping and calling help. A [[christian|Christian]] trader donated cloth without conditions of faith. A path made for [[convenience|convenience]] still owed compensation for vegetables. On the clinic’s [[behalf|behalf]], Shen signed a numbered debt rather than claiming rescue exempted payment. The owner could finally accept a concrete promise.","Inquiry must not [[victimize|victimize]] workers again. The [[scandal|scandal]] did not entitle demands for repeated accounts of a [[horrible|horrible]] injury. Ji respected his friend’s refusal. Gu carried a [[portable|portable]] rod for their [[mission|mission]]: upstream performance of the covenant. Xu would not [[wander|wander]] for free, so transport costs were written. His [[cabin|cabin]] held cargo; three households held evidence. Luo’s [[heel|heel]] was raw, but chose to leave trained successors and inspect the [[variety|variety]] of upstream sources.","They would [[persist|persist]] despite fatigue. Public wells no longer required red tickets, though disputes remained. At an upstream fork, a chain closed a common branch for three sects’ cultivation, leaving only surplus below. Their seals matched the old covenant and Xu’s transport records; no unknown mastermind was needed. They measured before dismantling and notified villages. Beyond the next ridge lay the tower. Han knew the old route and must provide knowledge while retaining responsibility. Their evidence exposed boundaries their home agreement had not yet reached."]});
